# Rust / Cargo
# NOTE: server/Cargo.lock is intentionally COMMITTED (not ignored). Tessera
# ships a binary crate and the spec (Always-boundary) mandates exact-patch
# reproducibility via the lockfile. Only build artifacts are ignored.
server/target/

